== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that drops a {{e|Bomb}} every 3 rooms.
** The first drop happens after 2 rooms.
** The bomb dropped can be a  {{e|Double Bomb}}, {{e|Troll Bomb}}, {{e|Mega Troll Bomb}}, {{e|Golden Bomb}}, or a {{E|Golden Troll Bomb}}.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Bomb Bag having the lowest priority at {{dlc|nr+}} 6th / {{dlc|r+}} 8th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: The familiar drops bombs in a repeating pattern of 2, 2 then 3 rooms.

